      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“最优先事项”……那是以前\n我和曼城茶座立下的约定……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc5f713fc4997b16615c494ab1e99a52ca2d49d8302a104bb5290ab2d2bff09b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
