      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样去远征的话，曼城茶座和我\n都可能会随着这个梦想一同殒落……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b0a41fffce29820657f28d8b81a6d4d8d697d5d623a567a7a28a907b829209",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
