      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使无法达成，能陪她走到最后我也心甘情愿……\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfab82dd144f9a7ca1637789c5d205054351d59bb3931ed75e2567d58762cb54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
